<table role="presentation" width="100%" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#ffffff;border-radius:12px;border-collapse:separate">
<tr><td style="padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:4px solid #78A472"><span style="font-family:Sora,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#4565A6">Pickle<span style="color:#3F6B3E">My</span>Paddle</span></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:24px">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Hi Sam,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Good news: we’ve checked your photos and we can re-grit your paddles.</p>
<table role="presentation" style="margin:0 0 16px;border-collapse:collapse"><tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;font-size:15px;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75;vertical-align:top">Re-grit</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-size:15px;color:#1E2E52;font-weight:600">2 × A$60 (both faces)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:2px 16px 2px 0;font-size:15px;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75;vertical-align:top">Total</td><td style="padding:2px 0;font-size:15px;color:#1E2E52;font-weight:600">A$120 plus return postage</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">[To confirm: payment link and how return postage is shown, added by SCRUM-9]</p>
<h2 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:17px;color:#1E2E52">Then post your paddles</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">[To confirm: postal address and packing tips]</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">We’ll email you when they arrive, and they’ll be back in the post within 10 business days of arriving.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 24px"><a href="https://www.picklemypaddle.com/order/status#TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT" style="display:inline-block;background:#4565A6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px">See your order’s progress</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75">This link is private to you: anyone who has it can see your order’s progress, but not your name or address. If you lose it, use “Email me my links” on the status page.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52">Thanks,<br>PickleMyPaddle</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1E2E52;opacity:.75">PickleMyPaddle: pickleball paddle re-grits, a small business operated out of Sydney.<br>https://www.picklemypaddle.com<br>Questions? Just reply to this email.<br>You’re getting this because an order was placed with this email address.</p>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>
",
  "subject": "PMP-7K3QX accepted: how to pay and post your paddles",
  "text": "Hi Sam,

Good news: we’ve checked your photos and we can re-grit your paddles.

  Re-grit: 2 × A$60 (both faces)
  Total: A$120 plus return postage

[To confirm: payment link and how return postage is shown, added by SCRUM-9]

THEN POST YOUR PADDLES

[To confirm: postal address and packing tips]

We’ll email you when they arrive, and they’ll be back in the post within 10 business days of arriving.

See your order’s progress:
https://www.picklemypaddle.com/order/status#TTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTTT

This link is private to you: anyone who has it can see your order’s progress, but not your name or address. If you lose it, use “Email me my links” on the status page.

Thanks,
PickleMyPaddle

PickleMyPaddle: pickleball paddle re-grits, a small business operated out of Sydney.
https://www.picklemypaddle.com
Questions? Just reply to this email.
You’re getting this because an order was placed with this email address.
",
}
`;

